{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_01",
  "title": "艾倫精選",
  "storyCode": "MN-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d27f3d83b3fc81f8eacbc722487c8c5b04c36e15aa4ce56d5bd7196450a7221d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "瑪莉婭！怎麼樣了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "稍等——馬上就好！就差一個螺絲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "擰緊點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "好的！啊，等等！我好像知道底部電池槽接觸不良的原因了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "快！這個點唱機太重了，我要抬不動了——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "你的起司片，老弗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......喂，這次不會爆炸了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "修個點唱機也能爆炸是不是誇張了點？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "不好說，和源石有關係的東西，老科瓦爾都能搞砸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "誰在說我壞話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "科瓦爾師傅！小、小心點！別亂晃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喔哦哦——抱歉，瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗！等我空出手來你就完了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "好，我等著——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "我這酒吧全靠你們兩個炒熱氣氛了，但是別打起來，砸了杯子要賠的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "他都叨叨幾十年了，你哪次見他動手贏得過我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "上次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "呃......上次我喝醉了，還犯關節炎......那不算數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟——哈，當年他陪著我趕赴邊疆的時候可不敢這麼和我說話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老弗！你是不是又在說什麼大話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "當年你是不是我的扈從！你就說是不是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "這都幾幾年了，扈從都已經穿上西裝變成你們的主子了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "瑪莉婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "噫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "啊——！痛！丫頭，你別突然放手啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "抱、抱歉......先讓我躲一下.....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "佐菲婭，輕點，這個月已經換了幾次大門了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "唉，這就是我不願意花錢換自動門的原因啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "發生什麼了，幹嘛這麼氣勢洶洶的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "在那兒是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪、莉、婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "噫——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "喂，丫頭，她走過來了，你好像沒藏住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗚......這個點唱機為什麼這麼小啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "她現在什麼表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "不妙哦，自上次她把那個喝醉的小鬼騎士扔出去之後我還沒看過她那麼生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "——啊，她微笑著走過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "那更不妙了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "科瓦爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "咳——老弗！來喝酒！你剛才是不是說我壞話了！我今天必把你喝趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "嘖，臨陣脫逃的膽小鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "那你怎麼不去幫瑪莉婭說說話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "我、我又不知道出什麼事兒！不要亂說話比較好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪、莉、婭，你躲什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你是不是......有什麼事瞞著我呀？雖然我已經全部知道了喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "哈、哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你知道騎士競技意味著什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "嚯......難怪佐菲婭那麼生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "為什麼不和我商量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "因為、因為佐菲婭姐姐一定會生氣的呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我當然會生氣了！因為你根本不明白你面對的是什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "噫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但我、我還是稍微瞭解過一點的啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......透過你姐姐？透過卡西米爾的耀騎士，特錦賽最年輕的奇蹟之一？是哦，你很瞭解呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "但——你——又——不——是——瑪——嘉——烈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "別、別揪我耳朵——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是、但是我們家現在的情況真的越來越糟糕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "說真的，明年我說不定就沒有床睡覺了！傢俱都要賣光了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "沒有長騎的騎士家族不會被認可，協會已經來催過很多次了......我、我也沒辦法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......就算這樣，你也可以住在我們家啊。浴池也很大，還有兩座花園......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不管怎麼說，你都不該這麼草率地成為競技騎士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......祖父去世之後，叔叔依舊不願意與騎士協會有什麼牽連......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐被趕出卡西米爾也有一段時間了，如果我還不能扛起一些責任的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "就算這樣，你也應該和我們商量一下才對......你太盲目了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "哎......所以這點我真心道歉啦......我是覺得佐菲婭姐姐你肯定會阻止我才......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我當然會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......那現在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......“耀騎士再度出現？臨光家族新騎士首秀，是否能奪回屬於貴族的榮耀？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "今天的競技新聞報頭條。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊哈哈......姐姐的名氣真大啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你還笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "雖然那些什麼都做得出來的媒體肯定會用奇怪的標題和謠言來造勢，但現在退出還來得及，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但如果不這麼做的話臨光家就會因為破產被剝奪騎士貴族的資格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我知道自己在做什麼，佐菲婭姐姐......我......不得不做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你啊......馬丁叔，你們對騎士競技是什麼樣的再清楚不過了，你也勸勸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "是啊，嗯，不如就讓她試試吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——哈！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "馬丁叔......！感謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不不不，現在的瑪莉婭連我一隻手都打不過喔，你確定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "這麼過分！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "話也不能這麼說，你畢竟是特錦賽十六強騎士。能正面贏你一隻手就已經過了合格線了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "就是，老弗現在都贏不了你一隻手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "你再說一遍！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "哈，這裡的常客都是些退役的老傢伙，實力也許不比從前了，但是論眼光......都是些老滑頭了，欸，反正我覺得行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "怎麼說話的！老滑頭又不是什麼褒義詞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "你懂我意思不就好了！你們這些騎士大爺講話文縐縐的不累嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "咳咳——老弗說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "我相信瑪莉婭的天賦，她的源石技藝和劍術資質並不差，從小陪她練劍的你應該很清楚吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......但是這幾年她都沉迷於機工技術，我還以為她也許想當個工匠......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "工匠只是興趣啦，雖然我也不想放棄這份興趣......但是必須要做的事情更重要吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "疼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......我還沒原諒你的自作主張，這次不是和你鬧著玩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "......這我倒是贊同佐菲婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "雖然我很贊許你那份為了家族豁出去還能保持樂觀的心態，但騎士競技並沒有觀眾和遊客們想的那麼風光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "應該說，不止有風光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老馬丁抬了抬他的手——他的大半隻胳膊都被替換成了金屬機械，關節處發出精巧的聲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "這只是一時不慎的結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "是啊......我記得。對手是個耍雙劍的維多利亞人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "但最後還是你贏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "對，還是我贏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "這就是所謂的榮耀，我現在擦個杯子都費事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "騎士競技，哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "競技場上不會有任何真正的憐憫和欽佩，只有灑下的血是貨真價實的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "觀眾的歡呼僅僅來自於刺激得到了滿足，贊助商的禮遇也只是單純的利益目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "想清楚，看清苦難再發起衝鋒，才是真正的騎士必須具備的素養。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......我明白的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......嗯。我是認真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "叔叔他一直說著，哪怕被剝奪貴族身份，臨光家的族徽就此消亡，也不代表“臨光”不復存在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但我還是想保護那些東西，保護姐姐和爺爺......一直捍衛的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姐姐不在了，作為臨光家最年輕的一代，我不能坐視臨光家沒落而無動於衷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "否則我會恨死自己的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "即使認識到一切殘酷也決意要踏上征途，這才是騎士，無論時代如何。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "我相信你能做到，這一杯敬你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "哈，我也是，敬瑪莉婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "（無言舉杯）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......唉，我還指望你們能勸勸她，別跟著一道起哄啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸......佐菲婭，佐菲婭姐姐，佐菲婭姑母，求求你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不要用輩分稱呼我！我才比你大五歲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......我好歹是臨光家的陪侍，我當然理解你的想法，但我還是覺得——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我會好好練劍的，一定會聽話的，相信我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "對了！不如就讓佐菲婭來做我的教練——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嚯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（糟——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "說起來，上次我們好好練劍，已經是什麼時候的事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......姐姐離開卡西米爾之前？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "那麼上次教你的劍技是哪一式？出自哪國？如何應用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呃......哈哈哈......是......是哪一式來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嗯，很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "明早在花園訓練場會合，你不會遲到的，對吧？騎士瑪莉婭小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗯？嗯......嗯，一定，一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
